.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/

# Generated outputs.
#
# CSVs and JSON are NOT committed: the pipeline regenerates them from fixed
# seeds via `make backtest`, and a stale checked-in artifact could silently
# contradict the code that claims to produce it. The README's numbers are
# reproduced by running the pipeline, and `make verify` re-checks every one of
# them against freshly generated output.
#
# Charts ARE committed, because they are documentation: the README embeds them,
# and a reader browsing on GitHub would otherwise see five broken images. They
# are regenerated byte-identically by the same command, so they cannot drift
# from the numbers without `make verify` failing.
reports/**
!reports/**/
!reports/**/*.png
data/raw/
data/processed/

# macOS
.DS_Store
